This folder contains third-party code that was not written by the REWIRE authors.

hlop_module.py is copied verbatim (byte-identical) from the official code release of Xiao, Meng, Zhang, He and Lin,
"Hebbian Learning based Orthogonal Projection for Continual Learning of Spiking Neural Networks", ICLR 2024:
https://github.com/pkuxmq/HLOP-SNN/blob/530b89aa19ca1b8e31bd43cf3af8db14a229da64/modules/hlop_module.py
(repository github.com/pkuxmq/HLOP-SNN, file modules/hlop_module.py, commit 530b89aa19ca1b8e31bd43cf3af8db14a229da64).
It is licensed under the Apache License 2.0; LICENSE in this folder is the licence file of that repository, copied unchanged.
It is used unmodified so that the HLOP baseline in this benchmark learns its subspaces with the authors' own Hebbian rule.
The training loop and the gradient projection of the baseline are REWIRE's implementation (rewire/models/arms.py,
rewire/modules/neuron.py). See README.md in this folder.
